                     <h2>LSUE in the News</h2>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-4">	<div class="card">		<div class="card-top">			<img src="https://www.lsue.edu/images/SmartAsset%20GFX.jpg" alt="20261117-lsue-news-smartasset "/>		<h3>			<a href="https://www.lsue.edu/mediacenter/20261117-lsue-news-smartassetranking.php">				LSU Eunice Named Louisiana's Best Two-Year College			</a>		</h3>		</div>		<div class="card-body">			<p>EUNICE, La. - LSU Eunice has been named the state of Louisiana's best two-year college by SmartAsset, the organization announced on Tuesday.</p>		</div>	</div></div><div class="col-md-4">	<div class="card">		<div class="card-top">			<img src="https://www.lsue.edu/images/original-7DF53CF0-9356-414C-8712-7910DE68CC38@1x_1-1.jpg" alt="20261103-lsue-news-taylortalk"/>		<h3>			<a href="https://www.lsue.edu/mediacenter/20261103-lsue-news-taylorsbritishembassy.php">				LSUE's Dr. Taylor Participates In American Revolution Event at British Embassy			</a>		</h3>		</div>		<div class="card-body">			<p>EUNICE, La. - LSU Eunice faculty member Dr. Michael Ray Taylor was a guest speaker in a lecture and discussion session exploring Scotland's connections to the American Revolution recent at the British Embassy in Washington, D.C.</p>		</div>	</div></div><div class="col-md-4">	<div class="card">		<div class="card-top">			<img src="https://www.lsue.edu/images/Default%20Event%2010950576.png" alt="20261029-lsue-news-ursi"/>		<h3>			<a href="https://www.lsue.edu/mediacenter/20261029-lsue-news-ursisymposiumpreview.php">				LSU Eunice To Showcase Student Research at URSI Symposium			</a>		</h3>		</div>		<div class="card-body">			<p>LSU Eunice will host its annual Undergraduate Research Summer Institute (URSI) on Friday, November 6 at 12:00PM inside the Dr. Anthony Mumphrey Center.  The free event will be in room 126.</p>		</div>	</div></div><div class="col-md-4">	<div class="card">		<div class="card-top">			<img src="https://www.lsue.edu/images/enrollment%20graphic.jpg" alt="20260922-lsue-news-fallenrollment graphic"/>		<h3>			<a href="https://www.lsue.edu/mediacenter/20260922-lsue-news-fall26enrollment.php">				LSUE Continues Growth, Sets Fall Enrollment Record			</a>		</h3>		</div>		<div class="card-body">			<p>EUNICE, La. - Louisiana State University Eunice is welcoming another record student population to campus with 4,698 students enrolled for the Fall 2026 semester.  It is the first time in school history that LSUE has a student enrollment of more than 4,000.</p>		</div>	</div></div><div class="col-md-4">	<div class="card">		<div class="card-top">			<img src="https://www.lsue.edu/images/BagleyGFX.jpg" alt="20260911-lsue-news-bagleygfx"/>		<h3>			<a href="https://www.lsue.edu/mediacenter/20260911-lsue-news-bagleyintro.php">				Acadiana Native Deshjuana Bagley Named LSUE Dean of Workforce Development and Applied Sciences			</a>		</h3>		</div>		<div class="card-body">			<p>EUNICE, La. - Louisiana State University Eunice is proud to announce the hiring of Deshjuana Bagley as the Dean of Workforce Development and Applied Sciences.  Dean Bagley will lead a newly created third college at LSU Eunice, joining the College of Health Sciences and the College of Arts and Sciences.</p>		</div>	</div></div><div class="col-md-4">	<div class="card">		<div class="card-top">			<img src="https://www.lsue.edu/images/LSU_6500.jpg" alt="20260910-lsue-news-academicteam"/>		<h3>			<a href="https://www.lsue.edu/mediacenter/20260910-lsue-news-workforcecollege.php">				LSU Eunice Establishes New Colleges Focused On Health Sciences, Workforce Development and Applied Sciences			</a>		</h3>		</div>		<div class="card-body">			<p>EUNICE, La. -  Louisiana State University Eunice has announced the creation of the College of Workforce Development and Applied Sciences, the university's third academic college and a significant expansion of its role in preparing students for Louisiana's evolving workforce.</p>		</div>	</div></div></div>
            </div>
         </section> 
         
         
